    {
      "source_key": "cheke-parish-2020",
      "citation": "Cheke, A. S. and J. C. Parish. 2020. The dodo and the red hen, a saga of extinction, misunderstanding, and name transfer: a review. Quaternary 3(1): 4. https://doi.org/10.3390/quat3010004",
