      "read": "full text"
    }
  ],
  "known_gaps": [
    "Cheke & Parish 2020: no known faunal lists including birds for the first Dutch settlement (1638-1658); only the 1647 Japan bird.",
    "Cheke & Hume 2008: after Verhoeff (1611) the Dutch were 'curiously silent' about dodos until 1662, with one mention in 1631.",
    "Hume 2006: after 1611 'the next mention occurred in 1631'.",
    "Cheke & Parish 2020: no native birds in Lamotius's reports of 1683 and 1690 or journal entries June-Sept 1678 and April 1682."
